  "answer": "To calculate the percentage change in Alarm.com's adjusted EBITDA from 2018 to 2019:\n\nPercentage change = [(New Value - Old Value) / Old Value] × 100\n\nOld Value (2018) = $93,081 thousand  \nNew Value (2019) = $108,307 thousand\n\nChange = (108,307 - 93,081) / 93,081  \n= 15,226 / 93,081  \n≈ 0.1636\n\nMultiply by 100:  \n0.1636 × 100 ≈ 16.36%\n\nAnswer: 16.36%",
